; The same script the SMF and IT twins run: the three segment boundaries
; by seconds, the same three by tick, and a build.
;
; 0.48 s is where segment 1 begins (one quarter at 480 000 us) and 0.88 s
; where segment 2 does (0.48 + 400 000 us). Both are exact f64 quotients
; of two exactly representable integers, so the bit patterns below are
; the arithmetic and not a rounding.
(times "0000000000000000" "3FDEB851EB851EB8" "3FEC28F5C28F5C29")
(at :tick 0)
(at :tick 46126080)
(at :tick 92252160)
(build :kind mid)
